# Data and results - never in git.
# scripts/ contains a 1.3 GB .h5ad and a 332 MB .h5Seurat sitting next to the code,
# and GitHub hard-rejects anything over 100 MB, so keep these out by extension
# rather than relying on remembering not to `git add .`.
*.h5ad
*.h5Seurat
*.rds
*.RDS
*.bam
*.bai
*.mtx
*.mtx.gz
*.loom

# Rendered reports - regenerate from the .Rmd instead (some are >10 MB).
*.html
# ...except the lab archive reports, where the rendered HTML IS the deliverable.
!lab_archives/**/*.html

# Working output that happens to live in scripts/
.snakemake/
logs/
figure/
Rplots.pdf
TRIAL_output_unhashed_donor_demux/
remove_me/

# R / Python / macOS cruft
.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/
.nextflow.log*
__pycache__/
.DS_Store
._*
